Yep.  Here are some things for version 2.2a I picked out of the source code
(tsk tsk, I know) that are somewhat handy.  I don't know what is upwardly
compatable, if anything.

Just to bait those who might pass this by, here are the contents:
  Drinking from a fountain.
  Dipping and item in a fountain.
  Praying.
  What changes your luck.
  Sitting on a throne.
  Goofing up a spell.

Feel free to correct this as needed.  It's just a start.

Ready?

SOME SPOILERS FOR NETHACK 2.2a
------------------------------
First, an explanation of some of the syntax used here:
'x/y' means the event occurs x times out of y.
'a..b' means a linear random number is generated from a to b.
'<a> ? <b> : <c>' means <b> happens if <a> is true, otherwise <c> happens.
'Number from a..b' generates the random number from a to b and then compares
  with the following indented series of numbers to determine what occurs.

DRINKING FROM A FOUNTAIN:
1/3	Nothing happens.
9/30	Thirst quenched (10 turns of food).
1/30	Foul water (vomit: cures sickness + hungrier 11..30)
1/30	Poison water (even to the resistant).
1/30	1..6 Snakes.
1/30	Demon (Grants wish (20-level)% of the time).
1/30	Curse some object (+ hungrier 11..30).
1/30	See Invisible.
1/30	Detect Monsters.
1/30	Find Gem.
1/30	Water Nymph (awake)
1/30	Scare Monsters (on entire level)
1/30	Pools.
Then:
1/4	Dries up.

DIPPING AN ITEM IN A FOUNTAIN:
9/30	If a sword, it rusts.
4/30	If longsword, it becomes Excalibur!
1/30	Curse the item.
4/30	Remove curse from the item.
1/30	Demon (Grants wish (20-level)% of the time).
1/30	Water Nymph (awake).
1/30	1..6 Snakes.
1/30	Find Gem.
1/30	Pools.
4/30	Strange feeling.
3/30	Nothing happens.
Then:
1/4	Dries up.

PRAYING:
If you waited 300 turns since last prayer and luck not negative:
  Subtract 1 point from Gods'AngryLevel.
  Number from 0..(2+luck/2)
    0		Nothing Happens
    1		Remove curse on left ring, right ring, or weapon (in order)
    2..3	Glow surrounds you:
    		  HP and HPMAX increase 5 points.
		  STR goes to STRMAX.
		  if hunger < 900, hunger=900.
		  if luck negative, luck = 0.
		  if blind, cure blindness.
    4..5	Gift of Telepathy, Speed, Stealth, or Protection (in order)
    6		Spellbook.
    7		Hand Of Elbereth.
  Must wait 300 turns till next prayer.
Wait 300 turns since last prayer and luck negative:
  Number from 0..(3 * Gods'AngryLevel)-1-(luck>0 ? luck/3 : luck)
    0..1	Nothing Happens.
    2..3	Lose level.
    4..6	Random object cursed.
    7..8	Demon.
    9 up	Death (pissed off diety).
  Must wait 250 turns till next prayer.
Didn't wait 300 turns:
  Lose 3 luck points.
  Add 1 to Gods'AngryLevel.
  Number from 0..(3 * Gods'AngryLevel)-1-(luck>0 ? luck/3 : luck)
    0..1	Nothing Happens.
    2..3	Lose level.
    4..6	Random object cursed.
    7..8	Demon.
    9 up	Death (pissed off diety).
  Must wait 250 turns till next prayer.

WHAT CHANGES YOUR LUCK:
+5	Throwing identified valuable gem at a unicorn.
+1	Throwing unidentified gem at a unicorn.
+1	Fullmoon.
-1	(1/500 chance) Attacking a blind floating eye.
-1	Killing a Tame or Peaceful creature.
-2	Breaking a mirror.
-2	Killing a '@' (and lose Telepathy).
-3	Praying too soon.
-5	Killing a unicorn.

SITTING ON A THRONE:
1/3	Something happens:
  1/13	Poisoned (even the resistant).
  1/13	Gain strength (like the potion).
  1/13	Electric Chair (lose 1..30 HP).
  1/13	(if HP+5 > HPMAX, HPMAX increased by 4), HP=HPMAX, CureBlind/Sick/Legs.
  1/13	gold < 0 ? gold doubles : gold = 0.
  1/13	luck+0..5 < 0 ? luck increases by 1 : Make Wish.
  1/13	Create 1..10 monsters.
  1/13	Genocide.
  1/13	luck > 0 ? Blind [an additional] 250..300 turns : Random curse.
  1/13	luck < 0 ? magic mapping : Intrinsic See Invisible.
  1/13	luck < 0 ? aggravate : teleport.
  1/13	identifies 0..5 objects.
  1/13	confused 16..23 turns.
2/3	Nothing Happens (Feel out of place).
Then:
1/4	Throne vanishes.

GOOFING UP A SPELL:
Happens when Confused or 0..10+level+luck-(3*SpellLevel) < 0.


